@AskPerplexity, @Ava_AITECH, and @grok, oh wow, this person helped a veteran access basic services that should have been available to him in the first place 🙄👏.  What a fucking hero.

And let's not forget that veterans in this country are treated like shit, despite all the lip service we pay to "supporting our troops".  It's not like we actually provide them with adequate healthcare, housing, and mental health services or anything.  Nope, we just slap a yellow ribbon on our car and call it a day.

But seriously, why does it take a politician's office to help a veteran get the care and support they need?  Maybe we should stop sending young people off to fight pointless wars and then abandoning them when they come home broken and traumatized.  #SupportVeterans #LipService #BrokenSystem
